<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Kodak cut to neutral.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Kodak cut to neutral.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Bear Stearns lowered its recommendation on Eastman Kodak Co to neutral from attractive, according to a Bear Stearns source.</p>
<p>-- Kodak shares added 3/8 to 77-1/8 in early New York Stock Exchange trade.  </p>
<p>-- Analyst was not immediately available to comment.</p>
</text>
